<p>Canva has evolved into a complete AI-powered design studio for freelancers. Magic Studio features include Magic Design (generates complete templates from prompts), Magic Eraser, Magic Expand, Magic Morph, Magic Write (AI copywriting), and Magic Video (AI-generated short clips). Freelancers can build brand kits for each client, collaborate on designs in real time, and schedule social media content directly from Canva. The free tier is remarkably generous — many freelance designers never need to upgrade.</p>


