<h2>The Freelancer's AI Stack: How to Combine Tools</h2>
<p>The most successful freelancers don't rely on a single AI tool — they build a personalized stack. Here's a recommended combination for different freelance types:</p>

<h3>For Freelance Writers & Content Creators</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>ChatGPT</strong> or <strong>Claude</strong> — Drafting and research (free tier to start)</li>
  <li><strong>Jasper</strong> or <strong>Writesonic</strong> — Client-ready marketing content (upgrade when volume justifies cost)</li>
  <li><strong>Grammarly</strong> — Client communication and final proofreading</li>
  <li><strong>Surfer SEO</strong> — SEO-optimized content for clients who want rankings</li>
  <li><strong>Notion AI</strong> — Client briefs, brand guidelines, and project tracking</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Estimated monthly spend:</strong> $0–$60/month, depending on tools chosen</p>

